  "implementation": {
    "rpc": "Optional single-owner observer spans request() through decoded JSON; only numeric duration, GET/POST enum and bounded outcome enum. Observer/clock/callback failures cannot change requests. Old unsubscribers cannot remove a new owner; stale in-flight callbacks are discarded.",
    "input": "Canvas capture retains one actual event; same-dispatch eventPhase/currentTarget gates navigation ownership. Numeric start/context alone enter pending; earliest coalesced input ends after Canvas drawing. Stale/null paint, context change, hidden/window blur/cancellation/disposal discard samples. Descendant blur preserves legitimate focus-to-Canvas input. No capture-microtask cleanup, timer or RAF.",
    "storage": "Three RAM-only rings capped128 each; project epoch/timeline/revision changes reset all rings. Snapshots copy numeric arrays/outcome counts and omit identities, paths, payloads and errors.",
    "panel": "Existing visible-only1Hz View/Diagnostics panel. RPC excludes direct fetch and media transfers; input is software dispatch-to-callback, not hardware/display latency. No new requests, endpoints or front-page controls."
  },
